{
  "ci": {
    "collect": {
      "staticDistDir": ".",
      "url": [
        "http://localhost/index.html",
        "http://localhost/services.html",
        "http://localhost/profit-leak-snapshot.html",
        "http://localhost/advisory.html",
        "http://localhost/contact.html",
        "http://localhost/menu-engineering.html",
        "http://localhost/blog/restaurant-consultant-cost.html",
        "http://localhost/about.html",
        "http://localhost/catering-profit.html",
        "http://localhost/virginia-neighbors.html"
      ],
      "_comment_numberOfRuns": "3, not 1. LHCI asserts against the MEDIAN run, so a single run gives a contended CI runner a casting vote. index.html failed once at TBT 234.5ms and performance 0.89 against thresholds of 200 and 0.90 — on a commit whose entire diff was three text substitutions, one of which made that page three characters shorter. Measured locally straight afterwards: TBT 0.0ms and performance 1.00, five runs out of five. The page has no blocking work; the runner simply had no CPU. Three runs costs about five extra minutes and stops CPU contention failing a build on its own.",
      "numberOfRuns": 3,
      "settings": {
        "preset": "desktop",
        "chromeFlags": "--no-sandbox --headless=new --disable-dev-shm-usage"
      }
    },
    "assert": {
      "assertions": {
        "categories:performance": [
          "error",
          {
            "minScore": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "categories:accessibility": [
          "error",
          {
            "minScore": 0.95
          }
        ],
        "categories:seo": [
          "error",
          {
            "minScore": 1
          }
        ],
        "categories:best-practices": [
          "warn",
          {
            "minScore": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "largest-contentful-paint": [
          "error",
          {
            "maxNumericValue": 2500
          }
        ],
        "cumulative-layout-shift": [
          "error",
          {
            "maxNumericValue": 0.1
          }
        ],
        "total-blocking-time": [
          "error",
          {
            "maxNumericValue": 200
          }
        ],
        "color-contrast": "error",
        "heading-order": "error",
        "image-alt": "error",
        "link-name": "error",
        "meta-description": "error",
        "document-title": "error",
        "html-has-lang": "error",
        "is-crawlable": "error",
        "unsized-images": "error",
        "uses-responsive-images": "off",
        "uses-text-compression": "off",
        "uses-long-cache-ttl": "off",
        "unminified-css": "off",
        "unminified-javascript": "off",
        "unused-css-rules": "off",
        "errors-in-console": "off",
        "csp-xss": "off",
        "link-in-text-block": "error",
        "label": "error"
      }
    },
    "upload": {
      "target": "temporary-public-storage"
    }
  }
}
